title: "NGS Variant Pipeline: reproducible Nextflow pipeline from reads to clinical variant report"
abstract: "Reproducible, containerised Nextflow pipeline from raw sequencing reads to an evidence-cited clinical variant report, covering germline, somatic and long-read variant calling with GIAB accuracy benchmarking and HL7 FHIR output."
